  "withoutDain": {
    "briefing": "Dain is dead. The ledger still names the Overseer and the Rootbinder, but the council needs more than accusations from the pack. Keep Lark in the central grove through three full enemy turns so she can carry the workers’ memories in a living branch. The Overseer’s remaining charter guards are attacking to destroy that evidence.",
    "hints": [
      "Protect Lark in the grove through three enemy turns.",
      "Leaving or losing the grove resets the vigil."
    ],
    "intro": [
